  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Stable release of the qualified integer instruction suite and mainline corrections across seven CPU models and the A1200 profile. Includes generic logical/immediate addressing with EORI postincrement, approved context-copy ownership fixes, and mandatory MC68000-family memory BTST prefetch after waited reads. Required integer semantic matrices, scoped architectural exceptions and shared-consumer tests gate publication. Five unresolved qualification areas remain explicitly deferred; physical CPU timing, FPU, enabled-MMU and general OS qualification are not implied. Publication authorized on 2026-10-22.",
